Package: SpectRalLibRaRies
Title: Spectral Libraries from Multiple MS/MS Databases
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Author: Adriano Rutz
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Adriano",
        family = "Rutz",
        email = "adafede@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0443-9902")
        )
    )
Maintainer: Adriano Rutz <adafede@gmail.com>
Description: A collection of MS/MS spectral libraries from
    major databases for metabolite annotation and mass spectrometry data analysis.
    Data is stored as portable data.frames with peaks (mz/intensity) as list
    columns, compatible with the Spectra package for RforMassSpectrometry workflows.
